WEBVTT

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.860
<i>I thought I had so much more potential.</i>

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.710
<i>Just so much more...</i>

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:21.010
<i>But...</i>

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.360
There it is!

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.190
<i>Saya-chan, Ouroboros at eleven o'clock!</i>

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:33.790
I know!

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.600
<i>Be careful, Saya-chan.</i>

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Everyone's heading out to support you.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.120
I know, I said!

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.750
<i>Don't do anything crazy 
before everyone gets there.</i>

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.760
I <i>know</i>, I said!

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.970
We have an Ouroboros!

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:46.810
Everyone, head out there quickly!

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.220
10-4. Roger.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.080
Too easy!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.430
I'm not doing anything crazy at all.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.260
The damage...

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.670
That's not enough splash-back to stop us!

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.640
I don't care if you're a UC-class!
Don't underestimate me!

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.230
You went in too fast, Saya-chan.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.530
You should have just waited 
for me to get here.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.320
Elel!

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.740
Three targets eliminated.

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:47.510
Amane, the next target.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.780
Hey, Stella, leave some for me.

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:59.740
You should take them all out for us

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.800
if you have enough time 
to joke around, Almaria.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.890
Are you glad you get some 
this time around, Nya?

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.850
You don't have to worry 
about me. It's annoying.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.280
They're heading for Seiran Island!

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.270
That's not good!

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:16.180
Everyone, intercept, please.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:17.620
10-4. Roger.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.520
Saya-chan!

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.230
I told you, I know!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.580
It's going to land on Seiran Island!

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.330
Is that...

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.460
Hinata-senpai!

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:31.870
Here I go!

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:41.880
Wow! That's an EXR, an EX Rebellion, for you!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.350
Aoi-chan, you're here?

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:56.440
Hinata Miumi, I won't let you take all the glory.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.610
We'll protect the island.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.910
You take the core.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:01.520
Right!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.530
Now, everyone, let's go!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.110
10-4. Roger.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.470
<i>There are five worlds in this universe.</i>

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.130
<i>The Black World, where night and magic reigns:</i>

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.870
<i>Darkness Embrace.</i>

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:24.370
<i>The Red World, protected by gods and prayers:</i>

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.000
<i>Terra Rubiri Aurora.</i>

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.450
<i>The White World, where 
science and technology rule:</i>

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.280
<i>System White Eguma.</i>

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:36.020
<i>The Green World, controlled by weapons 
and the military: Grunewald Silt.</i>

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:40.520
<i>And finally, the Blue World: Earth.</i>

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:47.190
<i>One day, the Halo, which connects 
the five worlds, opened without notice.</i>

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.170
<i>The World Connect...</i>

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.370
<i>A sign of impending destruction.</i>

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.510
<i>The power source that sustains the worlds,</i>

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.900
<i>the World Crystals, will lose their power,</i>

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.170
<i>and when the five worlds join completely,</i>

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.350
<i>all will be destroyed.</i>

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.230
<i>That is the end of the worlds: World End.</i>

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.590
<i>In order to save the worlds,</i>

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:18.380
<i>girls with the power to do just that have 
assembled on Seiran Island on Earth,</i>

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.240
<i>the Blue World.</i>

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:26.100
<i>People call them the Progress girls, 
with the special ability known as Exceed.</i>

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.970
<i>And those who have the ability</i>

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:33.750
<i>to link with the Progress and amplify 
their powers are called α-drivers.</i>

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:38.030
<i>The Progress can use powerful 
abilities based on the strength of</i>

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.040
<i>their relationship with their α-driver.</i>

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:44.540
<i>In order to prevent the end 
of all the worlds, World End,</i>

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.760
<i>these girls continue to fight the Ouroboros.</i>

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.190
<i>At approximately 10:00 this morning,</i>

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.490
<i>there was an Ouroboros attack.</i>

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.280
<i>They were successfully repelled</i>

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.200
<i>by a Progress Squad before they 
could reach Seiran Island.</i>

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:36.430
<i>The interception was led by 
α-driver Ayashiro Amane,</i>

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.210
<i>along with the UC, Uncradle: Sougetsu Saya,</i>

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.710
<i>Almaria, Elel,</i>

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.630
<i>Code Ω 77 Stella,</i>

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.040
<i>and Nya Lapucea,</i>

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.660
<i>with EXR Hinata Miumi</i>

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.010
<i>and SR Mikage Aoi providing backup.</i>

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:55.800
<i>All units were destroyed.</i>

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:59.950
There've been a lot more scrambles lately.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.600
That's our job, isn't it?

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.490
Why do you think we did all that 
training in the Blooming Battles?

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:10.760
Seiran Island is the place where all 
the Progress have gathered to resist.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.820
It's the highest priority for an enemy attack,

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.900
and as a result, it's become a battlefield.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.940
What does that mean?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.820
It means that the enemy—

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:21.810
Who cares about the details?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.660
Bad guys come, and we destroy them.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.160
That's all there is to it.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:28.870
Good work, everyone.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.080
Oh, Amane-chan.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:38.710
You need to be faster when 
giving us orders, Amane-chan.

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:41.390
I didn't get to be the first on the scene.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.950
Well, Saya-chan found the enemy first.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:48.900
I want to defeat lots more and raise my score!

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.050
No point in rushing.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.470
Slow and steady wins the race.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.980
Blah.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.100
Good job, Almaria.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:08:00.030
You rely on my skills far too much, Amane.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.320
I guess that means I'm just that strong, though.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:06.870
Thank you, Almaria. I'm counting on you.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.360
Good work, Stella.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:10.880
I barely worked.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.790
I've finished cooling down after 
operating at battle speed.

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.520
Damage to my parts is minimal.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.000
10-4. Roger.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.000
I'm sure you had a tough time, too, Nya.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.470
Oh, no need to thank me.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.290
I didn't really do anything.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:30.440
But it would be nice if I could 
take it a bit easier next time.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.400
Sure, I'll do my best.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.110
Good work, Saya-chan.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:37.830
That's it?

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.410
Good job!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.660
Saya-chan?

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:47.960
You do realize I didn't follow your 
orders during that last battle, right?

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.420
You didn't?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.850
Yes, and then I got hit by the enemy...

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.960
You did?

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.920
I did!

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.070
When a Progress takes damage,

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.630
it splashes back to the α-driver, right?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.300
Well...

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:02.890
Just a little bit.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.180
Then don't you have anything else to say?

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.500
Hmm...

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.320
Don't worry about it!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.470
You're supposed to get mad at me!

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:14.340
You're an α-driver!

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.890
Well, you're the one doing 
all the hard work to fight.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.870
It doesn't work like that!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.390
You need to do a better job!

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:26.180
I want to get into a higher 
class as soon as I can!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:30.550
If I take it easy, I'll be 
stuck in UC-class forever!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:37.920
But, Saya-chan, you worked really hard 
to get from C to UC, didn't you?

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.520
You're already really strong.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.640
Whatever...

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.360
I'm kind of tired.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:53.580
10-10. Good work!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.160
<i>My senpai...</i>

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>They're all Progress in class SR or higher.</i>

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.140
<i>The ability to control light...</i>

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.080
<i>That's my Exceed.</i>

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:32.350
<i>One day, out of the blue, 
that power was bestowed on me.</i>

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.780
Come on, just for today.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.240
Let's have some fun.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.440
My parents will yell at me.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.340
Let's go. Just for a little bit.

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:54.200
"I'm going to be stuck at work.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.700
Warm up your dinner."

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.430
This sucks.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.210
What is that?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:14.690
Huh?

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.510
<i>Something no one else could imitate...</i>

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:22.390
<i>A power all my own.</i>

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.350
<i>It was beautiful.</i>

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.360
<i>It was so wonderful.</i>

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.280
<i>I thought I was so cool.</i>

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.860
<i>I thought I was special.</i>

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:31.610
<i>I thought I could do anything.</i>

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.160
But...

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:37.320
This isn't special.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.020
Saya-chan.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.170
Student Council President Hinata.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.770
Aurora-sama!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.540
Welcome back, Clara.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.830
This is the data on the battle.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:01.780
Ayashiro Amane's team was the one 
that intercepted this time, huh?

00:12:02.310 --> 00:12:06.020
She's still UC-class, 
but she has a promising future.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.810
Indeed, Ruby-san.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:13.990
Student Council President Hinata and 
Mikage Aoi-senpai helped out, though.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:17.450
A lot of Ouroboros attacked.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.090
We trained every day for this,

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.210
to prevent the worlds from ending.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:28.710
And to fight the Ouroboros 
that wish for the World End.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.440
Yufiria...

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:34.390
But why did they start attacking here now?

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.270
Isn't it because it's the 
main base for the Progress?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.210
<i>Then they should have been 
attacking us before.</i>

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:40.850
Huh?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.700
Dr. Michael!

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:46.680
<i>We only recently detected the Ouroboros.</i>

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:48.680
Something must have caused it...

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:49.790
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.620
<i>My subordinates are analyzing it.</i>

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.960
We should make sure we're on the lookout.

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.450
Yeah.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.710
Thank you for today.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.720
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.080
Anyway, what's wrong, Saya-chan?

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.340
Did you have a fight with Amane-chan?

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.840
Were you watching?

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.650
No, I wasn't trying to peep.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.900
It just seemed like you were arguing...

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:20.710
It wasn't really a fight.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:23.700
Want to talk about it?

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:24.270
Huh?

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.030
Go ahead.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.200
I have trouble dealing with her.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:30.740
Trouble?

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.200
I'm sure she's a good person, but...

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.200
She just goes with the flow.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.260
She wants everyone to like her.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:40.930
Depending on who she's talking to, 
she changes completely.

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:44.420
I want to get into a higher class.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.460
I want to be an EXR like you and do great work.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.590
I want to do the best I can...

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:54.510
But Amane isn't thinking about that at all.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.020
It just bothers me whenever I see her.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.400
That's because you're still inexperienced!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.400
Mikage-senpai!

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.770
You're inexperienced, so you 
concern yourself with others.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.400
If you were perfect, you wouldn't 
need to worry about anyone else.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:14.710
Hinata Miumi, I don't care about you!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:16.550
I don't care about you one iota!

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:17.860
<i>She totally does...</i>

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.300
I won't lose to you!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.010
Neither will I.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.700
Let's do our best, Aoi-chan.

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:29.040
<i>A relationship where they both 
make each other better...</i>

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:38.300
Sofina-senpai, are you working 
on making a magical circle?

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.780
Almaria?!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.230
No! I was just doodling!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:47.360
You sure work hard, Sofina-senpai.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.120
Work hard?

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:53.100
I'm a prodigy. Why would I need to do that?

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:57.390
You know, I saw your scramble today.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:04.020
Actually, I'd like to ask you a favor...

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.630
Ramiel-chan!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.300
Elel-chan!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.690
You have such beautiful wings.

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:18.940
Isn't it hard taking care of them?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.600
It's really not.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.930
I just wash them with shampoo and air-dry them.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.230
Your wing is beautiful too, Ramiel-chan.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.940
It's pure white and has a shine to it.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.110
Um...

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.490
Don't worry about it.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.640
I don't worry about it myself.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:38.820
I used to have a bit of a complex over it,

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:40.120
but I'm fine now.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.830
When I link with my α-driver, 
I have wings of light.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:50.040
Yeah! Your wings are awesome!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.180
Yeah!

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:55.090
So anyway, I have a favor to ask you.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.480
Export flight data.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:06.520
System optimization and 
mutation code, running.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.870
Applying to custom parts.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:14.730
Tuning yourself up again, 
Code Ω 77 Stella?

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:17.250
Code Ω 33 Carene.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.820
You'll stress your core if you overdo it.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:24.210
That's why I'm calculating everything now.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.040
I'm figuring out how much speed I can handle.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:31.310
I don't know why you're so fixated on speed.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.030
Very well...

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.740
Let me see it.

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:38.780
Carene?

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:42.230
Execution of your mutation code is slow.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:47.270
I'll allocate the processing resources 
from my spatial distortion engine.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.530
I am grateful for your help.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.320
Oh, yeah...

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.700
What is it?

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:56.470
Could I ask you to help with something else?

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:02.560
It looks like you're training 
under a waterfall, Nya.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:08.820
Oh? And what would Eins Exaura, the strongest 
enhanced human in Grunewald Silt,

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:11.500
want with failure like me?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.180
I saw the data from today's battle.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.640
You're getting too soft.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:19.800
Don't put me in the same league 
as a top scorer like you.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.450
You're not going to dodge it?

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.630
I couldn't dodge it in time.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.700
I know you could see them.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:32.440
True.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:35.990
Nya, you're not going to fight for real?

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.700
For real?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:41.130
I want to do the best I can.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.410
Saya-chan...

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:47.760
I want to get to EXR and 
be stronger than everyone.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.070
In that case, practice with me.

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.300
We're training.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:53.710
Training?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.620
Yes.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.550
I want to get to a higher class

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.500
and catch up to you, Sofina-senpai.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.120
That sounds good.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.220
I want to get to EXR someday, too.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.200
Right?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.890
Ramiel-chan, help me.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:11.010
It's true that if you class-up, 
your potential will also rise.

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.640
That's an efficient way to raise my speed.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.700
Let's do it.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.650
Too much effort.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.410
α-driver Ayashiro Amane here.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:53.730
Thank you, everyone.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:55.920
We're ready here, too.

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:59.210
Beating us is a shortcut to going up in class.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.060
You need to get from UC to R class.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:04.910
But it won't work out that easily.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.110
Prepare yourselves.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.030
Let's do this.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.310
Everyone, here goes!

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.790
Exceed Link!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.020
Fireball!

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:23.150
Exceed Link: Blood Blade RH+O!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.670
Here I go!

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:31.430
She repelled me with steam from the blood?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.260
Not bad.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:35.230
Now, here I go!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:36.810
I won't lose!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.870
Exceed Link: Miracle White Blade!

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.720
Exceed Link: Air Friend!

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:46.720
I'll need your help, Ramiel-chan!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:53.870
Stella, Nitro Booster.

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:55.610
10-4. Roger.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:58.300
Exceed Link: Nitro Booster.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.750
You're certainly fast, but...

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:11.010
I'm also confident in my speed.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.970
Nya, I don't have to tell 
you anything, do I?

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.130
You do understand.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.390
You shouldn't look away. It's dangerous.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.060
<i>Aoi-senpai is strong...</i>

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:29.030
In that case...

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:31.030
Now!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.740
Saya-chan, it's too soon!

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:39.420
With her eyes closed?

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.090
I can sense you.

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.220
Special technique...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.710
Setsuna no Toki!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.460
Great will of the Black World...

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:59.940
Blood Spear Organized RH+A!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.710
My power...

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:06.350
Amane, the Link!

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:09.070
Almaria...

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:12.990
Amane-chan, the Link!

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:15.040
Miracle White Blade!

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:19.830
The Link...

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.360
My output is falling.

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:22.420
What's wrong?

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.590
You're losing speed.

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:30.350
Damn it...

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.470
M-My power...

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:34.310
Amane...

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.190
Saya-chan...

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:42.270
The Link...

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:43.190
This is it!

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:44.390
Too slow!

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:55.490
Too bad, huh?

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:58.080
It's okay!

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:01.710
There'll be another chance!

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:02.600
No, there won't.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:03.200
Huh?

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.830
There won't!

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:05.960
There won't be a next time!
